1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:58,920
Run !

25
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,440
Hold on tight !

26
00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:10,000
Help me !

27
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,320
Save me !

28
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:27,800
What is this ?

29
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:29,760
Senior Brother, what do we do !?

30
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:31,920
The Foreign Battlefield is collapsing !

31
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:33,800
Hurry to the teleportation formation !

32
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,080
Ma Liang...

33
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:57,200
War God Shrine disciple from the Burning Fire country...

34
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:58,920
Teleportation formation...

35
00:02:59,160 --> 00:03:00,320
I have 3 days...

36
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,560
You’re courting death !

37
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:11,880
So you guys

38
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:13,360
have also crossed the rift.

39
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,160
Little brother,

40
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,640
I never thought you’d actually do it.

41
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:28,320
Those two old fools

42
00:03:28,320 --> 00:03:29,560
asked me to talk to you.

43
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:31,120
Since this space is collapsing,

44
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,560
what are your plans now ?

45
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,120
Will you stay here

46
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:36,160
and devour this place with us ?

47
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:39,960
I'll use the teleportation formation to return to the mortal world.

48
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,120
Th...that’s impossible !

49
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,560
Newborn Soul Devourer,

50
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:44,680
there’s something you don’t understand.

51
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:46,360
The souls here

52
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:48,480
cannot leave this place.

53
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,680
Cultivators stand no chance

54
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:53,560
against the power of the souls here.

55
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:56,640
If wandering souls enter the mortal world,

56
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:58,680
they’ll be called devils

57
00:03:58,680 --> 00:04:01,400
and bring a catastrophe to the world.

58
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:04,600
That is why the law of the world

59
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:07,000
exists between the dead and the living.

60
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:09,480
Any who dare to cross it

61
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:11,520
will be erased.

62
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:14,760
Then what is the Foreign Battlefield ?

63
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,520
This chaotic place

64
00:04:16,520 --> 00:04:18,960
was created by powerful beings of the mortal world

65
00:04:18,960 --> 00:04:21,840
and exists between life and death.

66
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,360
That's why

67
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:26,640
Soul Devourers and wandering souls

68
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:29,640
were only able to enter this place when it started collapsing.

69
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,640
Still,

70
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:32,440
you won't be able to leave.

71
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:34,800
Let alone those wandering souls.

72
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:37,240
As long as this place doesn’t fully collapse

73
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:39,160
and I activate the teleportation formation,

74
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:41,120
what will stop me from leaving ?

75
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:43,680
Fine,

76
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,120
since we are friends,

77
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:48,280
I will try to slow down the collapse

78
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:50,360
but you can’t stop the wandering souls

79
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,640
from hunting.

80
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,360
One more thing.

81
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,160
I need your help.

82
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,760
We’ll be safe at the teleportation formation.

83
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:03,560
Keep going !

84
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,680
Junior Brother Ma Liang never returned

85
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:12,880
so he must be dead.

86
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:14,400
Lin Tao
War God Shrine disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

87
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:13,880
We're out of luck,

88
00:05:13,880 --> 00:05:15,840
where did these monsters come from ?

89
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:19,320
Yang Xiong
War God Shrine disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

90
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:18,560
Junior Brother Ma,

91
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,160
quick !

92
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,160
Everyone, I'm here,

93
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:20,840
wait for me !

94
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:23,760
Ma Liang...

95
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:25,880
I'm glad he's alive.

96
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:30,880
This time,

97
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:32,120
we’re done for !

98
00:05:35,880 --> 00:05:36,680
Scram !

99
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,440
The heavens are in our favor,

100
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:43,040
they want me to survive !

101
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:43,840
Junior Sister,

102
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:46,840
I don’t know why those monsters stopped attacking us

103
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:48,480
but we can’t stay here.

104
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:51,000
Let’s go to the teleportation formation

105
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:52,760
so we can leave the Foreign Battlefield.

106
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:53,960
Okay.

107
00:05:53,980 --> 00:05:56,000
Junior Brother Ma, stay close to us

108
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:57,360
since you're the weakest.

109
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,640
Stop wasting time.

110
00:05:58,640 --> 00:06:00,360
If you're not going, I'll go.

111
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:03,080
Stay close and be careful.

112
00:06:03,440 --> 00:06:04,240
Okay.

113
00:06:04,440 --> 00:06:06,120
Now I understand why Ma Liang

114
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:08,270
was grateful to Zhou Zihong in his memory.

115
00:06:08,270 --> 00:06:10,240
Since I’ve taken his body,

116
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:12,080
I should fulfill some of his wishes

117
00:06:12,080 --> 00:06:13,720
even if I have other plans for these three.

118
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:14,800
Thank you, Senior Sister.

119
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:19,560
This body has no spiritual energy,

120
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:21,560
I'm driving it with my Divine Sense.

121
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:23,440
Once I leave the Foreign Battlefield,

122
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:25,640
I need to find a place to cultivate.

123
00:06:27,960 --> 00:06:31,840
2 days later

124
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:37,240
Where is the teleportation formation ? I still don't see it.

125
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:39,320
We chose the closest one to us.

126
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:41,800
Don't you feel like

127
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:44,240
the collapse has slowed down lately ?

128
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,520
Weird...

129
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:48,080
Logically, it should be accelerating.

130
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:51,640
It’s been 2 days.

131
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:54,280
They’re probably dead.

132
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:55,640
Keep looking.

133
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:59,080
Ge Yang and Xu Hao know the real Ma Liang is dead

134
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:00,640
so they must die.

135
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:03,200
The teleportation formation requires a token

136
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:06,000
but they also stole Ma Liang’s token.

137
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:08,140
I'd like to find it if possible.

138
00:07:08,200 --> 00:07:09,440
If I can't find it,

139
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:13,000
I’ll need to steal a token from my fellow sect members.

140
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:16,480
You're really cunning for a Soul Devourer...

141
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:17,680
Alright,

142
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,680
I’ll keep looking.

143
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:21,320
Zihong, be careful !

144
00:07:31,320 --> 00:07:33,080
There’s something wrong with Ma Liang.

145
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:34,200
Our smooth journey

146
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:35,320
is not a coincidence.

147
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:37,160
Ever since Junior Brother Ma returned,

148
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:39,640
these creatures stopped attacking us.

149
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:41,720
If you want to live

150
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:43,200
don’t ask questions.

151
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:09,680
We found what you wanted.

152
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:10,400
Stop here.

153
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:15,000
He can control the wandering souls !?

154
00:08:17,200 --> 00:08:18,880
According to the Soul Devourer,

155
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:22,320
wandering souls are beings made of Divine Sense.

156
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:24,800
They're driven by instinct to devour everything.

157
00:08:24,840 --> 00:08:27,320
But this soul's ethereal body is weird.

158
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:29,240
It looks like devouring so much Divine Sense

159
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:31,040
can leave traces.

160
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:33,960
It must have mutated.

161
00:08:34,160 --> 00:08:35,160
Kill him.

162
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:39,960
I bear no grudge against Ma Liang.

163
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,200
Senior, please spare me !

164
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:43,320
I... I'm willing to become your slave.

165
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:44,480
Please spare my life !

166
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:45,960
Stop.

167
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:51,440
Senior,

168
00:08:51,430 --> 00:08:53,870
I would be honored to become your slave

169
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:56,320
and return safely to the Burning Fire country.

170
00:08:56,320 --> 00:09:00,240
Note: Lin Tao is giving his Soul Blood to Wang Lin here, he is willingly becoming a slave.

171
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:03,320
I’m not bloodthirsty by nature

172
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:05,520
but if you’re not smart...

173
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:07,840
I’ll have no choice but to be.

174
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:18,760
Junior Sister, you...

175
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:19,960
Senior,

176
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,400
I’ve been meaning to ask.

177
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:23,880
When you possessed Ma Liang,

178
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:26,600
was he alive or dead ?

179
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:27,760
Dead.

180
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,680
This wandering soul

181
00:09:43,680 --> 00:09:45,040
is now mine.

182
00:09:45,560 --> 00:09:47,640
You sure don't hold back, do you ?

183
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:48,440
Fine,

184
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:49,640
you can have this wandering soul,

185
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:50,880
if you like it.

186
00:09:50,880 --> 00:09:53,960
But I advise you to return to the Void with us.

187
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:56,240
This is the fate of a Soul Devourer.

188
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:58,560
What if I insist on leaving ?

189
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:01,160
You three go first.

190
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:03,120
Yes Master.

191
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,640
Why are there so many monsters ?

192
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:14,950
There are too many !

193
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:15,840
When will the teleportation formation activate ?

194
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,440
This is terrifying, there're too many.

195
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,040
Don’t worry,

196
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:19,080
they can’t enter.

197
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:21,600
Junior Sister Li !

198
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:22,960
Hurry, Junior Sister !

199
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:23,960
Go faster !

200
00:10:32,640 --> 00:10:33,600
We’re safe.

201
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:36,120
These wandering souls won’t touch the barrier.

202
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:36,120
Why are there so many monsters ?

203
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:37,200
As long as we stay inside

204
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:38,240
they won’t dare to enter.

205
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:40,040
Can we really survive this ?

206
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:41,320
Is this barrier

207
00:10:41,640 --> 00:10:45,080
the law of the world separating the dead from the living ?

208
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:52,200
Almost there,

209
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:53,600
the formation is about to activate.

210
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,600
Look over there,

211
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,360
there are 3 cultivators.

212
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:03,080
Why aren't the wandering souls attacking them ?

213
00:11:04,160 --> 00:11:05,680
What’s happening ?

214
00:11:08,400 --> 00:11:10,880
The monsters are making way for them !

215
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:23,360
Why are the monsters killing themselves ?

216
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:25,080
Is someone’s controlling them ?

217
00:11:25,680 --> 00:11:26,360
Little brother,

218
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,400
it’s useless.

219
00:11:27,400 --> 00:11:30,040
The teleportation formation is the entrance to the mortal world.

220
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:31,840
Any soul that touches it

221
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:33,320
will be erased instantly.

222
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:39,640
The monsters have gone mad,

223
00:11:39,640 --> 00:11:41,440
they’re trying to break the barrier !

224
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:51,720
These black threads

225
00:11:52,040 --> 00:11:54,520
must be the law of the world.

226
00:11:58,240 --> 00:11:59,560
Let's try this.

227
00:12:11,640 --> 00:12:13,840
They’ve all been erased.

228
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:17,040
Let’s see how many it can stop.

229
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,400
You go.

230
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:46,240
No way !

231
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:47,760
It’s broken through !

232
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:52,040
Junior Brother !

233
00:12:59,160 --> 00:13:00,480
Could it be

234
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:03,600
that my Divine Sense can briefly resist the law of the world ?

235
00:13:11,880 --> 00:13:13,200
These black threads seem designed

236
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:15,400
to annihilate souls.

237
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:17,440
The black threads are harmful to us,

238
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:18,560
are you okay ?

239
00:13:19,040 --> 00:13:19,960
I'm okay.

240
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:22,720
But if there are too many threads,

241
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:24,360
I'll be in trouble.

242
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:27,240
Ge Yang and Xu Hao have looted people for 50 years,

243
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:29,640
they must have good artifacts.

244
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:36,120
This is perfect for the Turtle Shell Formation.

245
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:59,000
It’s open !

246
00:13:59,160 --> 00:14:00,080
It’s open !

247
00:14:00,800 --> 00:14:02,080
It’s finally open !

248
00:14:02,080 --> 00:14:04,080
Finally, we can leave this hellhole.

249
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:05,400
Thank god !

250
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:06,680
I can finally leave.

251
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:11,600
You three go first,

252
00:14:11,800 --> 00:14:13,120
wait for me outside.

253
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:14,280
Yes Master.

254
00:14:19,680 --> 00:14:20,280
Are you leaving ?

255
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:21,160
Yes.

256
00:14:21,480 --> 00:14:22,800
Thank you

257
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:24,520
for everything you did.

258
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:32,960
I underestimated these black threads.

259
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:35,520
The moment it saw a powerful Soul Devourer,

260
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:37,360
it took the initiative to attack...

261
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:23,640
I have no choice but to endure.

262
00:15:32,520 --> 00:15:34,360
Is this the Ji Realm !?

263
00:15:38,880 --> 00:15:41,320
I’ve already died once.

264
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:42,400
This time,

265
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:44,040
no one can stop me !

266
00:15:54,720 --> 00:15:56,640
Can he survive this ?

267
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:04,400
The law of the world

268
00:16:04,400 --> 00:16:07,400
is accidentally refining his soul with his Ji Realm.

269
00:16:11,880 --> 00:16:13,920
Law of the world...

270
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:16,200
Come at me !

271
00:16:31,880 --> 00:16:34,320
He really entered the mortal world...

272
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:37,120
Will he still be a Soul Devourer out there ?

273
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:39,720
His Soul Devourer essence will remain

274
00:16:39,880 --> 00:16:41,480
but his Divine Sense

275
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:44,160
and his Ji Realm were merged by the law of the world.

276
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:45,480
That means,

277
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:46,920
his Ji Realm Divine Sense

278
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:48,040
will be able to

279
00:16:48,040 --> 00:16:50,600
annihilate cultivators of the same level instantly.

280
00:16:51,080 --> 00:16:52,760
Teng Huayuan...

281
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:55,000
I, Wang Lin, am coming back !

282
00:16:55,800 --> 00:16:58,520
You and your Teng Family will pay.

283
00:16:58,520 --> 00:17:00,520
Blood for blood.

284
00:17:03,370 --> 00:19:05,520
The Ji Realm was a very extraordinary realm. Normally, the Ji Realm comes from spiritual energy, however, Wang Lin currently didn’t have any spiritual energy, but his soul started to show signs of the Ji Realm.

[...] Wang Lin’s soul collapsed the moment the giant hand touched him, but the moment it collapsed, it was put back together by the mysterious Ji Realm and continued resisting.

[...] Each time, his Ji Realm got stronger, especially this time. Wang Lin’s soul charged toward the Ji Realm and was refined each time it was shattered. During this second, Wang Lin’s large soul underwent more than 10 000 reconstructions. His soul gradually shrunk and condensed, but its quality went through an earth shattering change.

The Ji Realm completely fused with his soul.

No one knows where the Ji Realm comes from, but it was certain that all of the cultivators that had the Ji Realm only had it in their spiritual energy. Only Wang Lin, through some fluke, had the Ji Realm imprinted to his soul.

In truth, the giant hand formed by the law of the world was the catalyst to allow Wang Lin’s soul to contain the power of the Ji Realm. After the Heaven Defying Bead fused with Wang Lin’s soul, there was a sliver of Ji Realm left in his soul. However, without these circumstances, once Wang Lin had regained his spiritual energy, this sliver of Ji Realm would've disappeared.

[...] If there was no law of the world and Wang Lin had tried to form his Ji Realm Divine Sense himself, he wouldn’t have been able to do it in his lifetime, but now it was complete.

285
00:17:09,190 --> 00:17:14,830
I've been walking this path for endless years

286
00:17:11,490 --> 00:17:14,830
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

287
00:17:15,470 --> 00:17:20,430
Is it the compass of fate

288
00:17:17,310 --> 00:17:20,430
that wrote this outcome for us ?

289
00:17:20,590 --> 00:17:26,350
The heavens want to erase your existence,

290
00:17:26,470 --> 00:17:32,070
that's the obsession guiding me.

291
00:17:32,350 --> 00:17:37,670
Is this the path to uncover

292
00:17:34,230 --> 00:17:37,670
truths from falsehoods ?

293
00:17:37,950 --> 00:17:43,270
In a world of murk and shadow,

294
00:17:39,850 --> 00:17:43,270
only the flame of truth can light the way.

295
00:17:43,310 --> 00:17:48,990
Look at them all,

296
00:17:46,190 --> 00:17:48,990
being carried by the waves.

297
00:17:49,430 --> 00:17:53,630
Look at them all,

298
00:17:51,590 --> 00:17:53,630
being drowned.

299
00:17:53,710 --> 00:17:56,950
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

300
00:17:56,990 --> 00:18:00,030
I will let the world refine my soul.

301
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:05,590
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

302
00:18:01,850 --> 00:18:05,590
I will fight.

303
00:18:05,590 --> 00:18:08,710
I'll break through the abyss of despair

304
00:18:08,710 --> 00:18:11,750
to finally learn who I really am.

305
00:18:11,750 --> 00:18:17,110
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

306
00:18:13,630 --> 00:18:17,110
I embrace this obsession.

307
00:18:17,110 --> 00:18:20,070
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

308
00:18:20,070 --> 00:18:22,870
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

309
00:18:22,870 --> 00:18:28,350
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

310
00:18:24,910 --> 00:18:28,350
I'll still fight.

311
00:18:28,550 --> 00:18:31,710
It's hard to avoid loneliness

312
00:18:31,710 --> 00:18:34,750
when you are above everyone else.

313
00:18:34,750 --> 00:18:40,430
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

314
00:18:37,070 --> 00:18:40,430
be afraid of a firefly ?
